1
00:00:00,538 --> 00:00:03,738
(Howard:)He's just decided
he's never leaving his apartment again.

2
00:00:03,908 --> 00:00:07,308
(Sheldon:)Oh. Brilliant.
I've been itching to pull that trigger.

3
00:00:08,279 --> 00:00:12,079
(Howard:)He's upset because
he can't get anywhere with women.

4
00:00:12,717 --> 00:00:15,417
(Sheldon:)Would it help if I gave him some pointers?

5
00:00:19,591 --> 00:00:21,521
I'm just funning you. Ha, ha.

6
00:00:26,765 --> 00:00:31,425
(Girl:)Hi. I don't know if you remember me
but I was here the other night at your party.

7
00:00:31,603 --> 00:00:34,033
(Stuart:)Oh, yeah, you left with Raj.

8
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:37,610
(Sheldon:)- Yeah.
- You're the one?

9
00:00:38,143 --> 00:00:39,403
(Howard:)Let me tell you something.

10
00:00:39,577 --> 00:00:43,567
(Howard:)That guy you blew off
happens to be my best friend.

11
00:00:43,748 --> 00:00:45,338
(Howard:)Okay? He was devastated.

12
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,110
(Penny:)Sorry.

13
00:00:47,285 --> 00:00:48,845
(Girl:)Can you just give him this?

14
00:00:49,687 --> 00:00:50,987
(Leonard:)Okay.

15
00:00:51,156 --> 00:00:55,286
(Howard:)But I gotta warn you,
Raj is a proud, passionate man.

16
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:58,590
(Howard:)If you go running out on him again...

17
00:00:58,763 --> 00:01:05,023
(Howard:)...you're only gonna get like three or four
more chances before you are history.

